---
import PricingLayout from '../layouts/PricingLayout.astro';
---

<PricingLayout>
	<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
	<section class="relative bg-[radial-gradient(rgba(237,232,216,.05)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[length:30px_30px] pb-[78px] pt-[138px] [-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(#000_60%,transparent)] [mask-image:linear-gradient(#000_60%,transparent)]">
		<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1120px] px-7">				<p class="mb-6 font-mono text-[13px] text-faint" data-rv><b class="mr-[10px] font-bold text-amber">❯</b>~/我的码/docs $ cat 合作执行手册.md --workshop</p>
			<h1 class="font-serif text-[clamp(36px,5vw,62px)] font-black leading-[1.3]" data-rv style="transition-delay:.08s">钱怎么算、活怎么干、<br>怎么退出——全写明白，<br><span class="text-amber">价格按手作坊来。</span></h1>
			<p class="mt-6 max-w-[680px] text-[16px] leading-[2] text-sub" data-rv style="transition-delay:.16s">一个人闭环的手作坊：没有团队、没有办公室、没有销售环节——<b class="font-medium text-ink">你付的每一块钱，基本都买在写代码这件事上</b>。协作走错峰节奏：你白天跑业务，我晚间深度施工，<b class="font-medium text-ink">早上你醒来，进展已经在那</b>。看完还有模糊的地方，算我写得不行，直接来问。</p>
			<div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-[14px]" data-rv style="transition-delay:.24s">
				<a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-[9px] rounded-[10px] bg-amber px-5 py-[11px] text-[14.5px] font-bold text-[#1d1405] transition duration-200 hover:brightness-[1.09] active:scale-[.97]" href="#modes">直接看三种模式
					<svg class="size-4 shrink-0" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 4v14"/><path d="M6 12l6 6 6-6"/></svg></a>
				<a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-[9px] rounded-[10px] border-[1.5px] border-line2 bg-transparent px-5 py-[11px] text-[14.5px] font-bold text-ink transition duration-200 hover:border-amber hover:text-amber active:scale-[.97]" href="#quiz">30 秒帮我选</a>
			</div>
			<div class="mt-[26px] inline-flex w-max max-w-full flex-wrap items-center gap-[10px] rounded-full border border-amber/40 bg-amber/5 px-5 py-[10px] font-mono text-[12.5px] leading-[1.6] text-amber" data-rv style="transition-delay:.3s"><span class="size-[7px] shrink-0 animate-dotp rounded-full bg-amber"></span>手作坊价 · 零公司成本 · 同期限量 · 签约锁价</div>
			<p class="mt-[26px] font-mono text-[12.5px] text-faint" data-rv style="transition-delay:.34s">3 种模式<b class="mx-[6px] font-normal text-amber">·</b>月费 ¥1,980 起<b class="mx-[6px] font-normal text-amber">·</b>小程序 ¥5,000 起<b class="mx-[6px] font-normal text-amber">·</b>0 句「详情面议」</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- ============ 01 速览 ============ -->
	<section class="py-[84px]" id="cmp" style="padding-top:48px">
		<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1120px] px-7">
			<div class="mb-[18px] flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-[22px]" data-rv>
				<span class="font-mono text-[13px] tracking-[.15em] text-amber">01 / 速览</span>
				<h2 class="font-serif text-[clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px)] font-black">三种模式，一屏对比</h2>
				<span class="ml-auto font-mono text-[12.5px] text-faint">$ diff 模式A 模式B 模式C</span>
			</div>
			<div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-[14px] border border-line2 bg-bg2" data-rv>
				<table class="w-full min-w-[820px] border-collapse text-[14px]">
					<thead><tr>
						<th class="border border-line bg-panel px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top font-serif text-[17px] font-black leading-[1.8] text-ink" style="width:120px"></th>
						<th class="border border-line bg-panel px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top font-serif text-[17px] font-black leading-[1.8] text-ink">MVP 冲刺</th>
						<th class="border border-line bg-panel px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top font-serif text-[17px] font-black leading-[1.8] text-ink">长期同行<small class="mt-1 block font-mono text-[10.5px] font-normal leading-normal text-faint">多数合作在这档</small></th>
						<th class="border border-line bg-panel px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top font-serif text-[17px] font-black leading-[1.8] text-ink">深度合伙</th>
					</tr></thead>
					<tbody>
						<tr><th class="whitespace-nowrap border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top font-mono text-[12px] font-normal leading-[1.8] text-faint">形式</th><td class="border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top leading-[1.8] text-sub"><b class="font-medium text-ink">一次性项目</b>，一口价</td><td class="border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top leading-[1.8] text-sub"><b class="font-medium text-ink">按月订阅</b></td><td class="border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top leading-[1.8] text-sub"><b class="font-medium text-ink">代码换股份</b></td></tr>
						<tr><th class="whitespace-nowrap border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top font-mono text-[12px] font-normal leading-[1.8] text-faint">周期</th><td class="border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top leading-[1.8] text-sub">2–4 周 + 2 周保障期</td><td class="border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top leading-[1.8] text-sub">最短 3 个月，之后按月续</td><td class="border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top leading-[1.8] text-sub">1–3 年，36 个月成熟</td></tr>
						<tr><th class="whitespace-nowrap border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top font-mono text-[12px] font-normal leading-[1.8] text-faint">花费</th><td class="border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top leading-[1.8] text-sub">约 <b class="font-medium text-ink">¥1.5k–15k</b>（起步价区间）</td><td class="border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top leading-[1.8] text-sub">¥1,980 / 3,600 / 5,800 / 8,800 每月四档</td><td class="border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top leading-[1.8] text-sub">0 现金 + 3–6% 股份</td></tr>
						<tr><th class="whitespace-nowrap border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top font-mono text-[12px] font-normal leading-[1.8] text-faint">适合谁</th><td class="border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top leading-[1.8] text-sub">想法待验证，先跑起来</td><td class="border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top leading-[1.8] text-sub">已有用户，要持续迭代</td><td class="border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top leading-[1.8] text-sub">已有付费用户，想做大</td></tr>
						<tr><th class="whitespace-nowrap border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top font-mono text-[12px] font-normal leading-[1.8] text-faint">付款</th><td class="border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top leading-[1.8] text-sub">¥3k 以下 50/50；以上 40/30/30</td><td class="border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top leading-[1.8] text-sub">月初付当月，不押金</td><td class="border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top leading-[1.8] text-sub">不付钱，签股权协议</td></tr>
						<tr><th class="whitespace-nowrap border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top font-mono text-[12px] font-normal leading-[1.8] text-faint">退出</th><td class="border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top leading-[1.8] text-sub">验收即止（含保障期）</td><td class="border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top leading-[1.8] text-sub">提前 2 周通知，随时停</td><td class="border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top leading-[1.8] text-sub">按成熟与回购条款</td></tr>
						<tr><th class="whitespace-nowrap border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top font-mono text-[12px] font-normal leading-[1.8] text-faint">协作节奏</th><td class="border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top leading-[1.8] text-sub">晚间+周末集中冲刺</td><td class="border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top leading-[1.8] text-sub">错峰协作 · 每周 1–3 个深度日</td><td class="border border-line px-[18px] py-[14px] text-left align-top leading-[1.8] text-sub">错峰协作 · 每年仅 1 席</td></tr>
					</tbody>
				</table>
			</div>
			<p class="mt-[14px] font-mono text-[11.5px] text-faint" data-rv>// 全部为验证期起步价（签约锁定，涨价不追溯）。不知道选哪种？往下走，30 秒测出来。</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- ============ 02 帮我选 ============ -->
	<section class="py-[84px]" id="quiz" style="padding-top:20px">
		<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1120px] px-7">
			<div class="mb-[18px] flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-[22px]" data-rv>
				<span class="font-mono text-[13px] tracking-[.15em] text-amber">02 / 帮我选</span>
				<h2 class="font-serif text-[clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px)] font-black">三个问题，测出你的模式</h2>
				<span class="ml-auto font-mono text-[12.5px] text-faint">$ ./which-mode --quick</span>
			</div>
			<div class="qz grid gap-4" id="quizBody" data-rv></div>
			<div class="qz-res mt-4 hidden animate-rise rounded-[14px] border border-green/35 bg-green/10 p-[26px_28px]" id="quizRes" data-rv></div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- ============ 03 定价政策 ============ -->
	<section class="py-[84px]" id="policy" style="padding-top:20px">
		<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1120px] px-7">
			<div class="mb-[18px] flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-[22px]" data-rv>
				<span class="font-mono text-[13px] tracking-[.15em] text-amber">03 / 定价</span>
				<h2 class="font-serif text-[clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px)] font-black">手作坊价：便宜有便宜的道理</h2>
				<span class="ml-auto font-mono text-[12.5px] text-faint">$ cat 定价政策.md</span>
			</div>
			<p class="mb-10 max-w-[660px] text-[15px] leading-[2] text-sub" data-rv>同样的需求找团队做，报价通常是我的 <b class="font-medium text-ink">2–3 倍</b>——不是我便宜，是团队贵：办公室、中层、销售提成、磨合损耗，全都在你的报价单里。手作坊没有这些环节；同时产能刻意保持很小，<b class="font-medium text-ink">同期只带 1 个冲刺 + 2 段长期维护</b>，每一单都是挑过的，做砸一单，亏的是我自己。</p>

			<div class="policy mb-[18px] grid grid-cols-1 gap-[18px] tab:grid-cols-2">
				<div class="rounded-[14px] border border-line2 bg-bg2 p-7" data-rv>
					<h4 class="mb-[14px] flex items-center gap-[10px] text-[17px] font-bold">按阶段定价<i class="rounded-[5px] border border-amber/40 px-[9px] py-[2px] font-mono text-[11px] font-normal not-italic text-amber">stage-based</i></h4>
					<p class="text-[14px] leading-[2] text-sub">价格跟着你的阶段走，而不是一口咬死：</p>
					<p class="text-[14px] leading-[2] text-sub"><b class="font-medium text-ink">验证期</b>（暂无收入，或月流水 &lt; ¥1 万）：本页所有价格，<b class="font-medium text-ink">起步价</b>。<br>
					<b class="font-medium text-ink">成长期</b>（月流水 ≥ ¥1 万 或完成融资）：之后的新合作恢复标准价（约 ×1.5）；<b class="font-medium text-ink">已签的合作不动</b>。</p>
					<p class="mt-[10px] text-[14px] leading-[2] text-sub">判断标准只有一个：<b class="font-medium text-ink">你有没有开始赚钱</b>。融资款不算你赚的钱——融资了也先按起步价走完当前合作。</p>
				</div>
				<div class="rounded-[14px] border border-line2 bg-bg2 p-7" data-rv style="transition-delay:.08s">
					<h4 class="mb-[14px] flex items-center gap-[10px] text-[17px] font-bold">三个承诺<i class="rounded-[5px] border border-amber/40 px-[9px] py-[2px] font-mono text-[11px] font-normal not-italic text-amber">locked</i></h4>
					<p class="text-[14px] leading-[2] text-sub"><b class="font-medium text-ink">锁价</b>：签约那天什么价，这个合作周期内就是什么价。我涨价只影响之后的新合作，绝不回头加钱。</p>
					<p class="mt-[10px] text-[14px] leading-[2] text-sub"><b class="font-medium text-ink">无息分期</b>：¥3,000 以下 50/50 两期；以上 40/30/30 三期；¥1.2 万以上可谈按里程碑拆 4 期。分期不加息。</p>
					<p class="mt-[10px] text-[14px] leading-[2] text-sub"><b class="font-medium text-ink">孵化器友好</b>：凭在孵证明（孵化器 / 加速器 / 校园创业项目）再享 9 折。我知道那段的现金流什么样。</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-[14px] border border-line2 bg-bg2" data-rv>
				<table class="w-full border-collapse text-[13.5px]">
					<thead><tr><th class="border border-line bg-panel px-4 py-3 text-left align-top font-mono text-[11.5px] font-normal leading-[1.7] text-faint" style="width:160px">你的阶段</th><th class="border border-line bg-panel px-4 py-3 text-left align-top font-mono text-[11.5px] font-normal leading-[1.7] text-faint">判断标准</th><th class="border border-line bg-panel px-4 py-3 text-left align-top font-mono text-[11.5px] font-normal leading-[1.7] text-faint">执行价格</th></tr></thead>
					<tbody>
						<tr class="bg-amber/5"><td class="border border-line px-4 py-3 text-left align-top leading-[1.7] text-sub"><b class="font-mono text-[15px] font-bold text-amber">验证期 · 起步价</b></td><td class="border border-line px-4 py-3 text-left align-top leading-[1.7] text-sub">暂无收入，或月流水 &lt; ¥10,000</td><td class="border border-line px-4 py-3 text-left align-top leading-[1.7] text-sub"><b class="font-mono text-[15px] font-bold text-amber">本页全部价格</b>（签约锁定）</td></tr>
						<tr><td class="border border-line px-4 py-3 text-left align-top leading-[1.7] text-sub">成长期 · 标准价</td><td class="border border-line px-4 py-3 text-left align-top leading-[1.7] text-sub">月流水 ≥ ¥10,000，或完成融资</td><td class="border border-line px-4 py-3 text-left align-top leading-[1.7] text-sub">约 ×1.5，仅对之后的新合作生效</td></tr>
						<tr><td class="border border-line px-4 py-3 text-left align-top leading-[1.7] text-sub">交叉地带</td><td class="border border-line px-4 py-3 text-left align-top leading-[1.7] text-sub">月流水 ¥5,000 – 10,000</td><td class="border border-line px-4 py-3 text-left align-top leading-[1.7] text-sub">两条路都通：继续起步价付费，或开始谈<b class="font-mono text-[15px] font-bold text-amber">深度合伙</b></td></tr>
						<tr><td class="border border-line px-4 py-3 text-left align-top leading-[1.7] text-sub">老合作</td><td class="border border-line px-4 py-3 text-left align-top leading-[1.7] text-sub">任何已签约的合作</td><td class="border border-line px-4 py-3 text-left align-top leading-[1.7] text-sub"><b class="font-mono text-[15px] font-bold text-amber">按签约价走完</b>，涨价不追溯</td></tr>
					</tbody>
				</table>
			</div>
			<p class="mt-[14px] font-mono text-[11.5px] text-faint" data-rv>// 判断标准是流水不是利润——赚钱了就该分我一杯「标准价」，这才叫长期主义。</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- ============ 04 模式详解 ============ -->
	<section class="py-[84px]" id="modes" style="padding-top:20px">
		<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1120px] px-7">
			<div class="mb-[18px] flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-[22px]" data-rv>
				<span class="font-mono text-[13px] tracking-[.15em] text-amber">04 / 详解</span>
				<h2>三种模式各自一页</h2>
				<span class="ml-auto font-mono text-[12.5px] text-faint">$ ls 模式/</span>
			</div>

			<div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line2 bg-bg2" data-rv>
				<div class="sticky top-0 z-[5] flex border-b border-line bg-panel" role="tablist">
					<button class="mtab flex-1 cursor-pointer border-0 border-r border-line bg-bg2 px-2 py-[14px] font-mono text-[12.5px] text-amber transition-colors duration-200 last:border-r-0 [box-shadow:inset_0_-2px_0_var(--color-amber)]" data-mode="mvp" role="tab"><i>01</i>mvp.sprint</button>
					<button class="mtab flex-1 cursor-pointer border-0 border-r border-line bg-transparent px-2 py-[14px] font-mono text-[12.5px] text-sub transition-colors duration-200 last:border-r-0 hover:text-ink" data-mode="month" role="tab"><i>02</i>monthly.md</button>
					<button class="mtab flex-1 cursor-pointer border-0 border-r border-line bg-transparent px-2 py-[14px] font-mono text-[12.5px] text-sub transition-colors duration-200 last:border-r-0 hover:text-ink" data-mode="equity" role="tab"><i>03</i>equity.md</button>
				</div>

				<!-- ===== MVP 冲刺 ===== -->
				<div class="panel animate-rise p-[36px_clamp(20px,4vw,44px)_44px]" data-mode="mvp">
					<div class="mb-[10px] grid grid-cols-1 items-start gap-9 tab:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr]">
						<div>
							<p class="mb-[10px] font-mono text-[12px] text-amber">$ man 我的码-mvp</p>
							<h3 class="font-serif text-[clamp(28px,3vw,38px)] font-black">MVP 冲刺</h3>
							<p class="mt-[10px] text-[15.5px] leading-[1.9] text-sub">用最小的一笔钱，把想法变成<b>能给真人用的东西</b>。固定周期、固定价格、固定交付物——先跑起来，再谈别的。</p>
							<div class="mt-[18px] flex flex-wrap gap-[9px]"><span>2–4 周</span><span>一口价</span><span>晚间+周末冲刺</span><span>含 2 周保障期</span><span>同期只带 1 个</span></div>
						</div>
						<div class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-bg p-[18px_20px] font-mono text-[12.5px]">
							<div class="mb-3 text-[11px] tracking-[.2em] text-faint">档案 / FACTS</div>
							<div class="grid grid-cols-[86px_1fr] gap-3 border-b border-dashed border-line py-[7px] leading-[1.7] last:border-b-0"><b class="font-normal text-faint">周期</b><span class="text-ink">2–4 周 + 2 周保障</span></div>
							<div class="grid grid-cols-[86px_1fr] gap-3 border-b border-dashed border-line py-[7px] leading-[1.7] last:border-b-0"><b class="font-normal text-faint">付费</b><span class="text-ink">两期或三期无息</span></div>
							<div class="grid grid-cols-[86px_1fr] gap-3 border-b border-dashed border-line py-[7px] leading-[1.7] last:border-b-0"><b class="font-normal text-faint">单价</b><span class="text-ink">¥600–800 / 人天</span></div>
							<div class="grid grid-cols-[86px_1fr] gap-3 border-b border-dashed border-line py-[7px] leading-[1.7] last:border-b-0"><b class="font-normal text-faint">上线</b><span class="text-ink">含部署·域名·提审</span></div>
							<div class="grid grid-cols-[86px_1fr] gap-3 border-b border-dashed border-line py-[7px] leading-[1.7] last:border-b-0"><b class="font-normal text-faint">节奏</b><span class="text-ink">晚间施工 · 晨间交付</span></div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="mt-[34px] border-t border-dashed border-line2 pt-[26px]"><div class="mb-[18px] flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-[14px]"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[.18em] text-amber">4.1</span><h4 class="text-[18px] font-bold">执行时间线</h4><em class="ml-auto font-mono text-[11.5px] text-faint">从语音到上线的 14 天</em></div>
						<div class="relative ml-[7px] grid gap-6 border-l-2 border-line2 pl-7">
